@RULE Immigration

Immigration: Life (B3/S23) in two colours, states 1 and 2. A survivor keeps its colour, and a cell
born takes the colour most of its three parents have.

From LifeWiki's Rule:Immigration (https://conwaylife.com/wiki/Rule:Immigration), last edited
19 December 2019. LifeWiki's content is available under the GNU Free Documentation License 1.2
(https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/fdl-1.2.html), and this file is distributed under those
terms, not ISC. It is LifeWiki's file unchanged except for this description; the link below
is the file's own, to the forum post it came from. Golly does not ship this rule.

https://conwaylife.com/forums/viewtopic.php?p=20043#p20044

